data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Card has borderLeft=1, borderRight=1, paddingLeft=16, paddingRight=16. With box-sizing: border-box, width=301.078 includes padding and border. So content width = 301.078 - 32 - 2 = 267.078.\n\nCard left border is at 485.453. Card content left = 485.453 + 1 + 16 = 502.453. Content width = 267.078. Content center = 502.453 + 133.539 = 635.992. Same as element center because padding/border are symmetric.\n\nPage content center = 16 + (1280 - 32)/2 = 640. So card content center is at 635.992, which is 4.008px left of page content center.\n\nWhy? Hmm. Maybe the h1 inside has margin that affects the card width? No, width is computed already.\n\nActually wait - the card's alignItems center is centering the h1 within the card, not the card within the page. The card is centered within Page by `justifyContent: center` on Page (which is flex with direction row by default? Actually Page is flex and alignItems:center, justifyContent:center, so it centers its child Card both horizontally and vertically). So card should be centered in Page's content box.\n\nBut measured card.left=485.453. Expected for centering in content box (width 1248): left = 16 + (1248 - 301.078)/2 = 16 + 473.461 = 489.461. Actual = 485.453. Difference = -4.008.\n\nWhere does 4 come from? Maybe Page also has some scrollbar gutter or something? No, no scrollbar.\n\nActually, perhaps I should check if the Card is centered visually by checking the h1 position relative to viewport. The h1 should be at viewport center. Let me check h1 center."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959744,"id":"chatcmpl-156350ba36cd47d189101c3e0289949b","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"command\": \"node -e \\\"\\nconst puppeteer = require('puppeteer');\\n(async () =\u003e {\\n  const browser = await puppeteer.launch({ headless: true, executablePath: '/usr/bin/chromium-browser', args: ['--no-sandbox', '--disable-setuid-sandbox'] });\\n  const page = await browser.newPage();\\n  await page.setViewport({ width: 1280, height: 800 });\\n  await page.goto('http://localhost:5173/', { waitUntil: 'networkidle2' });\\n  await new Promise(r =\u003e setTimeout(r, 1000));\\n  const r = await page.evaluate(() =\u003e {\\n    const h1 = document.querySelector('h1');\\n    const b = h1.getBoundingClientRect();\\n    return { h1Center: b.left + b.width/2, viewport: window.innerWidth/2 };\\n  });\\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(r));\\n  await browser.close();\\n})();\\n\\\"\", \"workdir\": \"/tmp\", \"timeout\": 120000}","name":"bash"},"id":"bash_44","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959744,"id":"chatcmpl-156350ba36cd47d189101c3e0289949b","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

